            "Recorded Sayings of Chan Master Dahui Pujue (大慧普覺禪師語錄), instruction to Chen Mingzhong (示陳機宜明仲). Dahui writes that boundless bad actions and ignorance right then shatter like tiles and melt like ice (惡業無明當下瓦解氷銷). This is Dahui's own prose.",
